  message: "Done in PR #3480 (ADR-0025, joint with WI-kofuh-fovar). Publish family classified: event_publishes → CANONICAL (relationship axis); crdt_publishes, annotated_publishes, emits, enqueues → FOLD (endpoint_shape; rename targets in ADR-0025 §Decision). One DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD: event_subscribes — production emit shape (subscriber→enclosing-function, structural containment) doesn't match the name (suggests pub-sub). Phase 3 producer rewrite picks the canonical replacement. Subscriber-shape inconsistency surfaced: production code (event_sourcing.py:866) and test fixtures (test_slice.py) have diverging mental models of what event_subscribes means — same edge_type, two incompatible shapes. Cross-family fold inbound: message_dispatch from the dispatch family folds into event_publishes (caught by per-pair audit of emit-site shape, not the name). Registry now reflects all verdicts; SCHEMA_VERSION bumped 0.2.6 → 0.2.7."  # 5280
